{"asset_key":"timeline/timeline_story_13111010","episode":"timeline","category":"timeline_story","story_id":"13111010","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:6:1311101001:1":{"text":"やっと終わった……一体なぜ大主教様が……？","source_cn":"终于结束了……大主教他……怎么会变成这样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE57A0E8059E7E773","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311101002:1":{"text":"ノヴィツキー大主教は誰もが認める敬虔な信徒よ。彼がこの国に来てから数十年、滅多に人里に出ない私ですら、人々が彼を讃える声を耳にしたことがあるぐらいだもの。","source_cn":"据我所知，诺维茨基大主教是位无可挑剔的信徒。从他来到白...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x111574D80C9EC48B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311101003:1":{"text":"直接会ったことはないけど、グレイヴボーンと人間を対等に扱い、とても善良で、誠実な人だと、カレリーナから何度も聞いたことがあるわ。","source_cn":"我没有和大主教打过交道，但卡列琳娜曾很多次提起过他，称...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x821E2B77D38E8E35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1311101004:1":{"text":"カレリーナは心から大主教を慕っていたのに……彼女が知ったらきっと悲しむわ……","source_cn":"卡列琳娜很是敬爱他，我……我没能救得了大主教，她一定会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F837622C11229CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1311101005:1":{"text":"そんなに信心深い方が一体なぜ……ここで何が起きたのです！？","source_cn":"可是，为什么像他这样虔诚的人都会堕落……这里究竟怎么了！？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF3D540DE7AF0399","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1311101006:1":{"text":"分からない……大主教は聖堂からの評価も高く、人々にも尊敬されている。そんな人が聖光を裏切る理由なんて……","source_cn":"我不知道……我想不明白，大主教深受圣堂器重，也被群众爱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDF08E1F32A0E313","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1311101006":{"text":"分からない……大主教は聖堂からの評価も高く、人々にも尊敬されている。そんな人が聖光を裏切る理由なんて……","source_cn":"我不知道……我想不明白，大主教深受圣堂器重，也被群众爱戴，没有任何背叛圣光的理由。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDF08E1F32A0E313","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1311101007:1":{"text":"本性を隠して、何十年も善人のふりをし続けるなんて、そんなことあり得るの？全くの別人になりきるのは、かなり困難なことよ。","source_cn":"几十年如一日去伪装成一个好人？不，这是很难做到的。毕竟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x669DD318AF70CE58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1311101008:1":{"text":"ひょっとして脅されたか、もしくは何かに誘惑されて？","source_cn":"或许他受到了威胁……或者是诱惑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC123BB9F4045BB7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1311101010:1":{"text":"もしかして、「偉大なる意志」では？でも、それは一体何なのでしょうか。","source_cn":"难道……是他说的那个“伟大意志”？那到底是什么东西啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59C4878F6FA9FD30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1311101011:1":{"text":"さあ……私も初めて聞く名前だわ。","source_cn":"即便是我，两千年来也从未听说过这个名字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B96BFAC5BA4DBEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1311101012:1":{"text":"でも、カタストロフの儀式、大主教の変容、時間がループする町……一度にこれだけの事が起きるなんて、どう考えても偶然じゃない。","source_cn":"但教堂里出现恶魔献祭仪式，大主教堕落，雪松镇陷入时间循...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EF2D93DAFF2A184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1311101013:0":{"text":"きっとカタストロフが関係しているのよ！あいつらの力はよく知っている、すべてを深淵に突き落とすような、絶望的な力……","source_cn":"这一切很肯定和恶魔有关！我见识过恶魔的本领……它们总能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC749599276DF7CD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1311101014:1":{"text":"これ以上誰も死んでほしくないのに……私たちを信用して、助けを求めてきたヤンコヴィッチ修道士まで……彼を置いていくべきじゃなかった……","source_cn":"已经死了太多人了……那位叫杨凯维奇的修士，他向我们求救...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AD8840C33A35239","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1311101014":{"text":"これ以上誰も死んでほしくないのに……私たちを信用して、助けを求めてきたヤンコヴィッチ修道士まで……彼を置いていくべきじゃなかった……","source_cn":"已经死了太多人了……那位叫杨凯维奇的修士，他向我们求救，他那么信任我们，可我们最后却将他留在这座教堂、留